# stmng
===
 See The Molecule new generation (STMng) is a chemical and crystallographic structures visualization and analysis tool that implements some of the functionalities of the old STM4 visualization tool. STMng primary use is to analyze the results of the USPEX (https://uspex-team.org/) computational material discovery system.
